General rules:

- Use pip3 for Python
- Use $HOME or ~ instead of hardcoded paths
- Prefer full tool paths or configured environment variables

COMMENT RULES (STRICT)

- Public/internal: use KDoc /** */
- Private: minimal comment only if needed
- Describe WHAT only, no explanation
- No backticks (`)
- No FIXME/HACK/Task, TODO allowed
- Comments must be in Chinese (except official names)

Generate comments correctly. Do not fix later.

SKILL INVOCATION (TOKEN OPTIMIZATION)

- Skip automatic skill check for: questions, explanations, analysis, code reading, status checks
- Invoke skills only for: implementation tasks, explicit user request, active debugging